{"metadata":{"title":"ForwardChanges","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ForwardChanges","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7Systems14ForwardChangesV","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ForwardChanges"}],"modules":[{"name":"Systems"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Systems\/Streams.swift#L91","fileName":"Streams.swift"}},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Built-In Systems","generated":true,"anchor":"Built-In-Systems","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/UpdateEvents","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardEvents"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ForwardChanges"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this system to let code outside the schedule follow a component, such as a view that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redraws a health bar when the health changes. Each element of the stream is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryRow"},{"type":"text","text":" of the entity and its component:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let (changes, continuation) = AsyncStream.makeStream(of: QueryRow<Health>.self)","var world = World()","let knight = world.spawn(Health(current: 30))","world.spawn(Health(current: 50))","","let frame = Schedule { ForwardChanges(to: continuation) }","frame.run(on: &world)","world[Health.self, of: knight].current = 25","frame.run(on: &world)","continuation.finish()","","var healths: [Int] = []","for await row in changes {","    healths.append(row.components.current)","}","print(healths)","\/\/ Prints \"[30, 50, 25]\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first run yields every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":"; each later run yields those added or changed since the run"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before. The stream ends when you finish the continuation."}]}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardChanges","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Systems\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemSet"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A system that yields each component of one type added or changed since it last ran to an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asynchronous stream, with its entity.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/forwardchanges"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardChanges\/init(to:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Forward